invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: a presented ticket of the right shape passes without its binding being
  compared, so a ticket received for one hostname resumes a connection
  to another, and that resumed handshake checks no certificate. The
  other-hostname, other-anchor and other-ticket rows object.

--- old
    uint32_t same = ct_memeq(expected, cfg->ticket_binding, SHA256_LEN);
--- new
    uint32_t same = 1;
